// EXPECT_COMPILE_ERROR E_FN_PROTO_METHOD_PARAM_MISMATCH
//
// D497 item 2 (registry 221.1 row 1994), DELIBERATE refusal pin: a method
// PARAMETER typed `any` in the slot vs `int` in the found protocol. Item 2
// compares method signatures by exact structural equality (D268 axes, no
// variance), so `any` != `int` refuses. This is NOT the item 7 Any-collapse:
// that permissive rule is the fn-TYPE boundary `fn(int)` in a `fn(any)` slot
